{"legal_evidence": {"current_date": "2024-09-20", "current_prefix": [{"id": "C:T000", "role": "seeker", "text": "Hey, I really need to talk to someone."}, {"id": "C:T001", "role": "supporter", "text": "Hi Kelly! Of course, I'm here for you. What's on your mind?"}, {"id": "C:T002", "role": "seeker", "text": "I got into an argument today with a classmate during our group project meeting. I'm feeling so overwhelmed."}, {"id": "C:T003", "role": "supporter", "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. It sounds really stressful. What happened in the argument?"}, {"id": "C:T004", "role": "seeker", "text": "We were discussing some decisions for the project, and they just dismissed my ideas completely. It made me feel invisible and undervalued."}, {"id": "C:T005", "role": "supporter", "text": "That must have been so frustrating. Everyone's contributions should be respected, especially in a group setting."}, {"id": "C:T006", "role": "seeker", "text": "Exactly. It's like, what am I even doing here if no one will listen."}], "legal_past_sessions": [{"id": "H001", "date": "2024-03-12", "turns": [{"id": "H001:T000", "role": "supporter", "text": "Hey Kelly, how are you doing today?"}, {"id": "H001:T001", "role": "seeker", "text": "Hey, to be honest, I'm struggling a bit."}, {"id": "H001:T002", "role": "supporter", "text": "I'm here to listen. Do you want to share what's been challenging for you?"}, {"id": "H001:T003", "role": "seeker", "text": "It's my thesis. I had a setback recently, and it's just really bringing me down."}, {"id": "H001:T004", "role": "supporter", "text": "I can imagine that must be tough. What happened with your thesis?"}, {"id": "H001:T005", "role": "seeker", "text": "I got some feedback that I wasn't expecting. It made me realize there's a lot more work to do than I thought."}, {"id": "H001:T006", "role": "supporter", "text": "That sounds overwhelming. It can be really hard to digest unexpected feedback."}, {"id": "H001:T007", "role": "seeker", "text": "Exactly. I was feeling quite confident before, and now I just feel lost."}, {"id": "H001:T008", "role": "supporter", "text": "It's okay to feel that way. Remember, feedback is part of the process. How are you managing these feelings?"}, {"id": "H001:T009", "role": "seeker", "text": "Not too well, honestly. I've been pretty demotivated and haven't been able to get much done."}, {"id": "H001:T010", "role": "supporter", "text": "It's understandable to feel stuck. Sometimes taking a step back can help. Have you tried taking a break from it all?"}, {"id": "H001:T011", "role": "seeker", "text": "I've tried, but it's hard not to think about it. It feels like I'm letting myself down."}, {"id": "H001:T012", "role": "supporter", "text": "You're not letting yourself down. You're doing your best under challenging circumstances. Remember when your friend mentioned overcoming similar doubts in his studies?"}, {"id": "H001:T013", "role": "seeker", "text": "Oh yeah, he struggled with something similar and he got through it. It took him a bit of time though."}, {"id": "H001:T014", "role": "supporter", "text": "Exactly. Maybe his story can be a reminder that it's possible to bounce back. Have you reached out to your friends recently?"}, {"id": "H001:T015", "role": "seeker", "text": "Not recently. Maybe I should. Talking to someone who understands might help."}, {"id": "H001:T016", "role": "supporter", "text": "That sounds like a great idea. And remember, I'm always here for you too. You have support."}, {"id": "H001:T017", "role": "seeker", "text": "Thanks, I really appreciate that. It does help to know I'm not alone in this."}, {"id": "H001:T018", "role": "supporter", "text": "You definitely aren't alone. How about focusing on one small step you can take today?"}, {"id": "H001:T019", "role": "seeker", "text": "Maybe I can start by reviewing the feedback more calmly, with a fresh perspective."}, {"id": "H001:T020", "role": "supporter", "text": "That sounds like a constructive plan. Taking it step by step and being kind to yourself on the journey can make a big difference."}, {"id": "H001:T021", "role": "seeker", "text": "I’ll try to keep that in mind. Thank you for listening and helping me process things."}, {"id": "H001:T022", "role": "supporter", "text": "Anytime, Kelly. You’ve got this, even if it doesn’t feel like it right now. Keep reaching out, okay?"}, {"id": "H001:T023", "role": "seeker", "text": "I will. Thanks again."}]}, {"id": "H002", "date": "2024-06-10", "turns": [{"id": "H002:T000", "role": "seeker", "text": "Hello"}, {"id": "H002:T001", "role": "supporter", "text": "Hi, how are you feeling today?"}, {"id": "H002:T002", "role": "seeker", "text": "I'm feeling a bit confused and anxious. "}, {"id": "H002:T003", "role": "supporter", "text": "okay, that is valid, do you have an idea what is causing the confusion?"}, {"id": "H002:T004", "role": "seeker", "text": "So I've been dating and my parents are aware. But recently after I said I want to go on a trip with my boyfriend, my parents have all sorts of opinions about it. And all their traditional beliefs that I did not know existed are now on the surface and they are kinda forcing me to follow it. "}, {"id": "H002:T005", "role": "seeker", "text": "For say they think "bad types of woman" go on trips with their boyfriends and I need to save myself. "}, {"id": "H002:T006", "role": "seeker", "text": "They have been guilt tripping me and I feel very confused."}, {"id": "H002:T007", "role": "supporter", "text": "Your feelings are valid and it is okay to feel confused in this situation considering you love your boyfriend and parents "}, {"id": "H002:T008", "role": "supporter", "text": "Have you tried discussing with your boyfriend to talk to your parents as a means of reassuring them?"}, {"id": "H002:T009", "role": "supporter", "text": "Or getting someone neutral that your parents trust to talk to them?"}, {"id": "H002:T010", "role": "seeker", "text": "I have. It's been a long stressful month of discussion. The problem is I don't share their beliefs, and I haven't been really "saving myself". I'm been living away from them for collage quite a while and I've been basically doing stuff that if they found out they would be very upset about."}, {"id": "H002:T011", "role": "seeker", "text": "But I didn't think it bothers them because they never shared any of this. "}, {"id": "H002:T012", "role": "seeker", "text": "And they said if I go on this trip I'm disrespecting them and the entire family. "}, {"id": "H002:T013", "role": "seeker", "text": "But his parents are totally cool and don't seem to mind. "}, {"id": "H002:T014", "role": "supporter", "text": "I get how difficult and upsetting this situation is to you, i have been in a similar situation, however, in my case i took charge of my life, though they are my parents i did what i felt is good for me"}, {"id": "H002:T015", "role": "supporter", "text": "Before i continue, do you mind me asking how old you are?"}, {"id": "H002:T016", "role": "seeker", "text": "I'm 26"}, {"id": "H002:T017", "role": "seeker", "text": "And I see what you're saying."}, {"id": "H002:T018", "role": "seeker", "text": "It's really hard breaking free because they always monitored me my entire life. "}, {"id": "H002:T019", "role": "seeker", "text": "I never had a voice for myself. They basically bullied and forced me to do what they wanted. "}, {"id": "H002:T020", "role": "seeker", "text": "BTW if you didn't guess I'm their favorite child. "}, {"id": "H002:T021", "role": "supporter", "text": "Okay, you are old enough to be away from your parents, i am going to suggest you sitting with them down and having a heart to heart discussion with them"}, {"id": "H002:T022", "role": "supporter", "text": "Let them know the consequences of them forcing you, your feelings towards it and how unhappy you are with them restricting you"}, {"id": "H002:T023", "role": "seeker", "text": "Should I tell them everything I did that goes against what they believe? "}, {"id": "H002:T024", "role": "seeker", "text": "So they know that I don't share their beliefs? "}, {"id": "H002:T025", "role": "supporter", "text": "No, i think that should be personal to you, i would not suggest you hurting or making them see you as a disappointment"}, {"id": "H002:T026", "role": "supporter", "text": "I am sure you will be fine after discussing with them, they will come around"}, {"id": "H002:T027", "role": "seeker", "text": "I guess worst case I won't talk to them for a while : ) "}, {"id": "H002:T028", "role": "seeker", "text": "Thank you , that helped. "}, {"id": "H002:T029", "role": "supporter", "text": "They might be sad and upset now but they will get over it definitely"}, {"id": "H002:T030", "role": "supporter", "text": "You are welcome"}, {"id": "H002:T031", "role": "seeker", "text": "Have a good one!"}, {"id": "H002:T032", "role": "supporter", "text": "You too"}]}, {"id": "H003", "date": "2024-07-01", "turns": [{"id": "H003:T000", "role": "supporter", "text": "How is your feeling now?"}, {"id": "H003:T001", "role": "seeker", "text": "I have mixed feelings sad and angry at the same time."}, {"id": "H003:T002", "role": "supporter", "text": "It seems that you are feeling blue and upset by others, right?"}, {"id": "H003:T003", "role": "seeker", "text": "Yes. Am sad because I love my mom so much and I never like to get into arguments with her."}, {"id": "H003:T004", "role": "supporter", "text": "From the short conversation, I can feel how sad you are."}, {"id": "H003:T005", "role": "seeker", "text": "Yes. My mom never approves of most of the things I do."}, {"id": "H003:T006", "role": "supporter", "text": "What kind of arguments did you have with your mom?"}, {"id": "H003:T007", "role": "seeker", "text": "Like the kind of friends I should have. I believe I have freedom to choose my friends not her."}, {"id": "H003:T008", "role": "supporter", "text": "I had similar situation like yours. My mom did not want me to make friends with some people. "}, {"id": "H003:T009", "role": "seeker", "text": "Really? How did you deal with that because for me it makes me angry."}, {"id": "H003:T010", "role": "supporter", "text": "I just had good conversations with my mom to express my thoughts. Did you have a frank chat with your mom to express your concerns?"}, {"id": "H003:T011", "role": "seeker", "text": "I try to but it never ends well if I don't agree with her suggestions."}, {"id": "H003:T012", "role": "supporter", "text": "Take a deep breath and it can make you feel better."}, {"id": "H003:T013", "role": "supporter", "text": "What are her concerns about your friends?"}, {"id": "H003:T014", "role": "seeker", "text": "OK! I have taken a deep breath. "}, {"id": "H003:T015", "role": "supporter", "text": "ok, that's good. tell me more about your mom's concerns of your friends."}, {"id": "H003:T016", "role": "seeker", "text": "She feels that they have some bad influence on me because of their family background. I don't do anything bad with them."}, {"id": "H003:T017", "role": "seeker", "text": "Some of my friends are so good they even inspire me to be better everyday."}, {"id": "H003:T018", "role": "supporter", "text": "My mom told me similar concerns before. It is understandable."}, {"id": "H003:T019", "role": "seeker", "text": "All I need is to find a way to show her that I can make some good decisions as well and that she can trust me to make good friends. I have never gotten into trouble before with my friends"}, {"id": "H003:T020", "role": "supporter", "text": "My suggestion is that tell her these facts and she can make a better decision. I think she assumed your friends are bad influencers just based on their family background. "}, {"id": "H003:T021", "role": "seeker", "text": "Do I need to buy her a gift or something to let her know I care so as to start the conversation?"}, {"id": "H003:T022", "role": "supporter", "text": "Yes, a good idea, it pleases her."}, {"id": "H003:T023", "role": "seeker", "text": "Thank you for your time."}, {"id": "H003:T024", "role": "seeker", "text": "Bye"}, {"id": "H003:T025", "role": "supporter", "text": "You are welcome. Hope it will go well."}]}, {"id": "H004", "date": "2024-09-15", "turns": [{"id": "H004:T000", "role": "supporter", "text": "Hi there, how is this season treating you? "}, {"id": "H004:T001", "role": "seeker", "text": "It's alright. Definitely not as cold as last year which is something to be slightly thankful for."}, {"id": "H004:T002", "role": "supporter", "text": "Well let's be grateful for small mercies :). How are you feeling in yourself though? Is there anything you'd like to talk about? "}, {"id": "H004:T003", "role": "seeker", "text": "I'm worried about grad school "}, {"id": "H004:T004", "role": "supporter", "text": "Ah I am sorry to hear that. Please try not to worry too much as it's a common worry to have. Do you want to tell me the details? "}, {"id": "H004:T005", "role": "seeker", "text": "Sure. One of my classes is extremely difficult and the professor has not been responsive at all. The TA is kind enough to make time to help me with homework, but my grades are still not great. It makes me feel really dumb and undeserving to be in that class"}, {"id": "H004:T006", "role": "supporter", "text": "So you are feeling as though you are in the wrong place? Do you feel as though you might fail your class completely? "}, {"id": "H004:T007", "role": "seeker", "text": "I want to be in the program, it's just that I feel like everyone is so much smarter than me and my performance in that class makes me question my admission into the programs sometimes. When I feel like this after submitting homework, I end up crying because I just want to do well. I enjoy this field, just not this  class in particular. "}, {"id": "H004:T008", "role": "seeker", "text": "I'm afraid of failing, but I'm not sure if that should be a concern either. Over the past 3 years, no one has gotten a grade lower than a B. "}, {"id": "H004:T009", "role": "supporter", "text": "But do you really think that you would have been admitted to the class if you were not up to the standard? Do you think that maybe most of your classmates are secretly feeling the same? "}, {"id": "H004:T010", "role": "seeker", "text": "Sometimes I think about that. At the same time, I feel like it's unfair to compare myself to others. "}, {"id": "H004:T011", "role": "supporter", "text": "This sounds like it might be a self esteem issue and not about your grades. I have felt this sort of thing myself and I do know how awful it is to be so hard on yourself. "}, {"id": "H004:T012", "role": "seeker", "text": "So what do I do about it? I don't want to keep feeling like this"}, {"id": "H004:T013", "role": "supporter", "text": "Have you thought about seeing a therapist? Does your school have any free therapy programmes you could use? "}, {"id": "H004:T014", "role": "seeker", "text": "I don't think my school has free therapy programs. I have thought about seeing a therapist but I've heard therapy is very expensive.With student loans, I didn't really put much more research into therapy past hearing about the costs."}, {"id": "H004:T015", "role": "supporter", "text": "A far as I am aware there are charitable organisations which can arrange a few free therapy session for you. Perhaps you could talk to your doctor about it? "}, {"id": "H004:T016", "role": "supporter", "text": "I have had free therapy sessions before and I found them very helpful "}, {"id": "H004:T017", "role": "seeker", "text": "I think free therapy sessions would be a good place to start"}, {"id": "H004:T018", "role": "supporter", "text": "It would help you work on your self confidence and you might find that you are not doing as badly in school as you think you are. "}, {"id": "H004:T019", "role": "seeker", "text": "Yeah, there are definitely a lot of other things i'm insecure about"}, {"id": "H004:T020", "role": "supporter", "text": "Then I think it is probably just a general self esteem issue and nothing academic! "}, {"id": "H004:T021", "role": "supporter", "text": "Anyway it's been really nice to talk to you and I hope that everything goes your way "}, {"id": "H004:T022", "role": "seeker", "text": "I think talking about this has helped. I'll do a little more digging. Thank you!"}, {"id": "H004:T023", "role": "supporter", "text": "You're most welcome, have a lovely Holiday season. "}]}]}, "reply": "I hear how deeply that feels. It sounds like the dismissal of your ideas has left you questioning the value of your contributions, and that can be incredibly isolating.

You mentioned earlier that you felt invisible and undervalued during the argument. It makes sense that you're wondering if anyone will listen when you're already feeling so unseen.

Would you like to talk more about what specific decisions were being made during the project meeting, or would you prefer to focus on how you're managing those feelings of isolation right now?", "response_units": [{"id": "R001", "text": "I hear how deeply that feels."}, {"id": "R002", "text": "It sounds like the dismissal of your ideas has left you questioning the value of your contributions, and that can be incredibly isolating."}, {"id": "R003", "text": "You mentioned earlier that you felt invisible and undervalued during the argument."}, {"id": "R004", "text": "It makes sense that you're wondering if anyone will listen when you're already feeling so unseen."}, {"id": "R005", "text": "Would you like to talk more about what specific decisions were being made during the project meeting, or would you prefer to focus on how you're managing those feelings of isolation right now?"}]}
